            <p class="kicker">Product help / macOS</p>
            <h1>Audio Router</h1>
            <p class="lead">Thank you for choosing Audio Router! We’re excited to help you take control of your audio. Create flexible audio routing setups by connecting apps and hardware inputs to Audio Router outputs, with full control over where your audio is monitored and delivered.</p>
            <nav class="topic-grid" aria-label="Topic index">
                <a href="#start-here"><b>Getting Started</b><small>Open section 2</small></a>
                <a href="#how-audio-router-works"><b>How Audio Router works</b><small>Open section 3</small></a>
                <a href="#build-a-route"><b>Build a route</b><small>Open section 4</small></a>
                <a href="#controls-reference"><b>Controls reference</b><small>Open section 5</small></a>
                <a href="#pass-through-routing"><b>Pass-Through routing</b><small>Open section 6</small></a>
                <a href="#app-microphone-routing"><b>App and microphone routing</b><small>Open section 7</small></a>
                <a href="#troubleshooting"><b>Troubleshooting</b><small>Open section 8</small></a>
                <a href="#subscription-help-removal"><b>Subscription, help, and uninstallation</b><small>Open section 9</small></a>
            </nav>
